    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39962" root="نضح" body-key="n">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتضح عَلَيْهِمُ المَآءُ</span></b>  <i>The water became
sprinkled upon them.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتضح البَوْلُ عَلَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الثَّوْبِ</span> <i>The urine became sprinkled upon the garment.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتضح بِالنَّضُوحِ</span> <i>He sprinkled
himself with the kind of perfume called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضُوح</span>.
(L.) [And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنضّح</span></b>  is used in similar sense in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غسل</span> in the K.] See 1.

